This is in continuation of my last mail sent to you regarding the porting o=
f LTP on Android 2.2 Froyo dated Aug 04, 2010.
We have ported LTP open source (Version: ltp-full-20110228) on Android 2.2 =
Froyo. It will validate the reliability, robustness, and stability of Andro=
id. We want to submit the same to open source community.
PFA patch for the same. Please let me know if I have to do anything else re=
garding submission of this patch.

Thanks & Regards,
